   "text": "On motion to recommit with instructions Failed by the Yeas and Nays: 187 - 220 (Roll no. 77).",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8A000",
   "actionDate": "2020-02-28",
   "actionTime": "11:56:12",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The previous question on the motion to recommit with instructions was ordered without objection.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2020-02-28",
   "actionTime": "11:43:47",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Floor summary: DEBATE - The House proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the Walden motion to recommit with instructions. The instructions contained in the motion seek to require the bill to be reported back to the House with an amendment to insert a new title at the end of the bill, \"Born-Alive Abortion Survivors Protection.\"",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H36100",
   "actionDate": "2020-02-28",
   "actionTime": "11:43:31",
   "committees": [
    {
     "name": "Energy and Commerce Committee",
     "systemCode": "hsif00",
     "url": "https://api.congress.gov/v3/committee/house/hsif00?format=json"
    }
   ],
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Mr. Walden moved to recommit with instructions to the Committee on Energy and Commerce. (text: CR H1286-1287)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30000",
   "actionDate": "2020-02-28",
   "actionTime": "11:42:12",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Considered as unfinished business. (consideration: CR H1286-1289)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2020-02-28",
   "actionTime": "11:11:43",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "POSTPONED PROCEEDINGS - Pursuant to clause 1(c) of Rule XIX, further proceedings on H.R. 2339 were postponed.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H35000",
   "actionDate": "2020-02-28",
   "actionTime": "11:11:14",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The previous question was ordered pursuant to the rule.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2020-02-28",
   "actionTime": "09:21:27",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with 90 minutes of debate on H.R. 2339.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2020-02-28",
   "actionTime": "09:19:19",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 2339 with 1 hour and 30 minutes of general debate. Motion to recommit with or without instructions allowed.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30000",
   "actionDate": "2020-02-28",
   "actionTime": "09:19:14",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 866. (consideration: CR H1257-1286)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H1L220",
